From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Hermes Studio Local Patches <local-patches@example.invalid>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 14:39:50 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] feat(providers): accept extra_headers and
 preserve_client_identity

Lets a custom provider in config.yaml carry two extra fields through
Studio normalisation and the provider editor API:

* extra_headers: request headers appended to coding-agent upstream requests
* preserve_client_identity: forward the spawned CLI's own identity headers

Both are read-only through the editor API, validated (single-line string
values, 64 KiB cap) and written back to config.yaml without dropping
unknown sibling keys.
